# Casa del Planeador (C5b, contract 48), 9 x 7, interior. column = i, row = j. The house behind the cuttable bush of Ruta 16: the GIRL gives the PLANEADOR module (flag 92 =
# `mod_planeador`, flag 834 = the gift was given; the module only flies with the Medalla Voltio). A bird-lover's room: posters of gliding birds on the walls, a bed, a table, a bookshelf.
@map casa_planeador
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@flag planeador_given 834
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  p  tile=none object=wall_poster_j text=plane.poster interact=look
  q  tile=none object=wall_poster_i text=plane.poster interact=look
  e  object=bed
  f  object=bookshelf text=casa.books interact=look
  h  object=table
  i  npc=chica id=girl face=SW script=girl
  j  object=candle_s
  k  tile=mat
@grid
  abbpbbcbb
  de..f.f..
  qe.......
  d..hi....
  d.j......
  d........
  d...kk...
@warp k -> ruta_16 spawn=plane_door
# The girl: the PLANEADOR at the first talk (the module is a flag, `setf mod_planeador`), then a last line.
@script girl npc
    npc_face_hero girl
    jf planeador_given said
    say plane.a
    say plane.b
    setf mod_planeador
    sfx item
    say plane.got
    say plane.about
    setf planeador_given
    end
  said:
    say plane.after
@end
